50\"}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"c73e13f\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"LA CIRCONSCRIPTION\",\"header_size\":\"h5\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"5d3e7ef\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Danyi \\u2014 Entre Nature & Excellence\",\"header_size\":\"h3\",\"title_color\":\"#38AB03\",\"title_hover_color\":\"#0FFC1A\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"b2239a1\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>Le plateau de Danyi, joyau verdoyant du Togo situ\\u00e9 \\u00e0 plus de 700 m\\u00e8tres d\'altitude, se distingue par son climat temp\\u00e9r\\u00e9 exceptionnel, ses paysages pittoresques de montagnes et sa population travailleuse. C\'est une terre d\'excellence agricole, r\\u00e9put\\u00e9e pour sa culture de caf\\u00e9, de cacao et ses riches mara\\u00eechages.<\\/p>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"a8a69a9\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p><strong>Climat et Altitude Privil\\u00e9gi\\u00e9s<\\/strong><br \\/>Un microclimat favorable propice \\u00e0 des cultures mara\\u00eech\\u00e8res uniques au Togo.<br \\/><br \\/><strong>Culture Artisanale &amp; Caf\\u00e9i\\u00e8re<\\/strong><br \\/>Terroir par excellence pour la production de caf\\u00e9 de haute qualit\\u00e9 et d\'arbres fruitiers.<\\/p>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"556ef17\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"100\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"100\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false},\"margin_tablet\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"\",\"right\":0,\"bottom\":\"\",\"left\":0,\"isLinked\":true},\"padding_tablet\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"75\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"10\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false},\"padding_mobile\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"55\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false},\"flex_direction\":\"row\",\"flex_align_ite