(1705, 1, '2026-09-22 16:11:17', '2026-09-22 14:11:17', '<h1>Nos Projets</h1>				\n				<h2 data-elementor-setting-key=\"infocard_title\" data-elementor-inline-editing-toolbar=\"basic\" >Education</h2>			\n					Interdum exercitation penatibus, praesentium facilisi accusamus fermentum, sagittis.				\n								<figure><img src=\"http://localhost/Senateur/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/pexels-photo-34526421-34526421.jpg\" alt=\"Four male students in uniforms reading together outside in school courtyard.\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"http://localhost/Senateur/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/pexels-photo-4587189-4587189.jpg\" alt=\"Young African boy focused on writing at his desk in a vibrant classroom setting.\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"http://localhost/Senateur/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/pexels-photo-39523812-39523812.jpg\" alt=\"Children eagerly holding up school supplies in a lively classroom setting.\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"http://localhost/Senateur/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/pexels-photo-39523816-39523816.jpg\" alt=\"A diverse group of children and adults holding books outside a school building, promoting education.\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"http://localhost/Senateur/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/pexels-photo-13980518-13980518.jpg\" alt=\"A striking image of the Togo national flag waving against a clear blue sky in Lomé, Togo.\" /></figure>			\n				<h2 data-elementor-setting-key=\"infocard_title\" data-elementor-inline-editing-toolbar=\"basic\" >Soutiens Agricole</h2>			\n					Interdum exercitation penatibus, praesentium facilisi accusamus fermentum, sagittis.				\n								<figure><img src=\"http://localhost/Senateur/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/pexels-photo-19163065-19163065.jpg\" alt=\"Black woman farming in a lush green field, showcasing manual agricultural labor.\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"http://localhost/Senateur/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/pexels-photo-14436367-14436367.jpg\" alt=\"A vibrant yellow cocoa pod hanging from a tree branch. Perfect for nature photography.\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"http://localhost/Senateur/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/pexels-photo-38799945-38799945.jpg\" alt=\"Bags of avocados and sweet potatoes at an outdoor market in Manzini, Eswatini.\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"http://localhost/Senateur/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/pexels-photo-29197085-29197085.jpg\" alt=\"Close-up of green bananas growing on a banana tree in a lush tropical garden.\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"http://localhost/Senateur/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/pexels-photo-10697911-10697911.jpg\" alt=\"A farmer tends to his cornfield using a backpack sprayer, amidst lush greenery and vibrant crops.\" /></figure>			\n				<h2 data-elementor-setting-key=\"infocard_title\" data-elementor-inline-editing-toolbar=\"basic\" >Culture &amp; Patrimoine</h2>			\n					Interdum exercitation penatibus, praesentium facilisi accusamus fermentum, sagittis.				\n								<figure><img src=\"http://localhost/Senateur/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/pexels-photo-999283-999283.jpg\" alt=\"Carved wooden masks with intricate designs displayed at a vibrant market.\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"http://localhost/Senateur/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/pexels-photo-37987885-37987885.jpg\" alt=\"Hand drumming on traditional African drums during an outdoor ceremony, colorful attire, cultural expression.\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"http://localhost/Senateur/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/pexels-photo-34228166-34228166.jpg\" alt=\"Colorful African festival featuring lively drumming and dancing performers in traditional attire.\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"http://localhost/Senateur/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/pexels-photo-17021986-17021986.jpg\" alt=\"Colorful traditional attire worn by young festival-goers in Ghana, celebrating culture.\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"http://localhost/Senateur/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/pexels-photo-17453654-17453654.jpg\" alt=\"Energetic group dance performance at a vibrant street festival.\" /></figure>', 'Projects', 